╭───────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Mode                                          │
│                                               │
│   1. As planned (Mode column, then            │
│      default_mode: auto)                      │
│   2. plan — plan first, you approve, then it  │
│      implements                               │
│   3. auto — Claude Code asks only about risky │
│      actions                                  │
│   4. accept — edits are accepted              │
│   5. manual — every action asks, whatever     │
│      Claude Code's default is                 │
│   6. default — your normal permission prompts │
│ › 7. plan:default — plan, then default        │
│   8. plan:accept — plan, then accept          │
│   9. plan:auto — plan, then auto              │
│   10. yolo [SKIP PERMISSIONS] — no permission │
│       prompts                                 │
│   11. plan:yolo — then [SKIP PERMISSIONS]     │
│                                               │